  "canonical_source": "wrl 0.1\ntier G1\ndt_max 1e0\nstimulus_unit 1\nstate s0 : 1 = 0e0\nstate s1 : 1 = 0e0\nstate s2 : 1 = 0e0\nparam p0 : s = 1e0 fixed\nlet n0 = state(s0)\nlet n1 = state(s1)\nlet n2 = state(s2)\nlet n3 = add(n1, n2)\nlet n4 = param(p0)\nlet n5 = euler_leak(n0, n3, n4)\nlet n6 = stimulus()\nlet n7 = sigmoid(n6)\nlet n8 = euler_leak(n1, n7, n4)\nlet n9 = tanh(n6)\nlet n10 = euler_leak(n2, n9, n4)\nnext s0 = n5\nnext s1 = n8\nnext s2 = n10\nobserve identity_v1(s0)\n"
